{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/4af1d2c15f1fc2b0a9c1156a8ea9845c.avif?t=1771334251\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/a807ea1ceee41ac30eb803e764072ec8.avif?t=1771334251\" width=1560 height=406 /></span><strong>Step into medieval nightmares and face the fears that lurk in the darkness.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i><strong>Doctor Dreams Simulator</strong></i>, you enter the dreams of those who come to your clinic, exploring dark fantasy worlds where each nightmare presents a unique challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront relentless enemies, overcome unexpected situations, and master ever-changing scenarios in every dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when you wake up, the pressure doesn\u2019t stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your clinic, prepare treatments, and protect your reputation while a rival clinic attempts to sabotage your work from the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of your legacy is tied to the truth about your father\u2026 will you reach it in time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medieval nightmares with unique challenges in every scenario</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clinic management with decisions that affect your reputation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suspicious patients and sabotage from a rival clinic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and improve treatments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story filled with mystery and progressive discoveries</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3775270?t=1771334251","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/9f0c1411da240d4f4db0d2afa4bfc2ca851e074b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771334251","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/6f45be4a360f4a2f59643dee0ab684287e323599/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771334251","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/6f45be4a360f4a2f59643dee0ab684287e323599/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771334251","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/4af1d2c15f1fc2b0a9c1156a8ea9845c.avif?t=1771334251\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/a807ea1ceee41ac30eb803e764072ec8.avif?t=1771334251\" width=1560 height=406 /></span><strong>Step into medieval nightmares and face the fears that lurk in the darkness.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i><strong>Doctor Dreams Simulator</strong></i>, you enter the dreams of those who come to your clinic, exploring dark fantasy worlds where each nightmare presents a unique challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront relentless enemies, overcome unexpected situations, and master ever-changing scenarios in every dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when you wake up, the pressure doesn\u2019t stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your clinic, prepare treatments, and protect your reputation while a rival clinic attempts to sabotage your work from the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of your legacy is tied to the truth about your father\u2026 will you reach it in time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medieval nightmares with unique challenges in every scenario</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clinic management with decisions that affect your reputation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suspicious patients and sabotage from a rival clinic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and improve treatments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story filled with mystery and progressive discoveries</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Papu's Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/8f0aa8c925b306adbafaa40ab19aff50f0fc44db/header.jpg?t=1771334251","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"<strong>\u00a9 2026 Papu's Studio. All rights reserved.  </strong><br>Doctor Dreams Simulator was independently developed.  <br>All visual, audio